# Allied 8 (ALL08U, Free Gateway) won by lane P24 through the step server (ra2/tools/ra2_step.py, ra2/tools/ra2_commander.py):
# Tanya, the GIs and the engineers (houses the player controls) up the eastern ramp and south along the elevated
# highway, down its southern ramp and west to the beacon compound; the eastern barrel force-fired (the chain takes the
# barracks, a coil, the gate and two reactors), Tanya's C4 on the two northern reactors (the coils go dead on low power)
# and on the Psychic Beacon; the MCV deployed by the arch, Tanya's C4 on the southern reactors, then the coils and flak;
# a base with prism towers and pillboxes, prism tanks massed and walked into the Soviet base by short sieges. The long
# quiet stretch (ticks 13,000-61,000) is a scripted builder waiting on a refinery it could not place. Replayed by
# ra2/tests/ra2_campaign.py (missions 1-7 forced won). Inputs and ticks only; no game-event shortcut.
